            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the authenticated key's monthly allowance, month-to-date usage, remaining credits, searches made in the current hour, the hourly rate limit, and the current subscription period. Poll this to stay inside the documented cap of 20% of the plan's monthly credits per hour.",
